{
  "id": "E245",
  "title": "Where Did It Rain The Most?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-08-01",
  "synopsis": "Jiejie and Yuanyuan compare the weather in Shanghai and Guangzhou.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/811/55a47fd028dcb7c6fcb0e72be82fb1930eb841cd.mp3?1532935075",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "哪儿的雨更大？\n\n圆圆：上个星期我去了上海，那儿的天气太糟糕了。\n杰杰：上海的天气一定没有广州的糟糕。\n圆圆：上个星期上海天天下雨。\n杰杰：广州也下了七天雨。\n圆圆：上海的雨大得人人都不能出门。\n杰杰：广州的雨大得火烈鸟都在街上游泳了。\n圆圆：我的天，广州的雨比上海大多了。",
    "traditional": "哪兒的雨更大？\n\n圓圓：上個星期我去了上海，那兒的天氣太糟糕了。\n杰杰：上海的天氣一定沒有廣州的糟糕。\n圓圓：上個星期上海天天下雨。\n杰杰：廣州也下了七天雨。\n圓圓：上海的雨大得人人都不能出門。\n杰杰：廣州的雨大得火烈鳥都在街上游泳了。\n圓圓：我的天，廣州的雨比上海大多了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Where Did It Rain The Most?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "圆圆：上个星期我去了上海，那儿的天气太糟糕了。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：上個星期我去了上海，那兒的天氣太糟糕了。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shàng ge xīng qī wǒ qù le shàng hǎi nà'r de tiān qì tài zāo gāo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: I went to Shanghai last week. The weather there was terrible."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "杰杰：上海的天气一定没有广州的糟糕。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：上海的天氣一定沒有廣州的糟糕。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié shàng hǎi de tiān qì yí dìng méi yǒu guǎng zhōu de zāo gāo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jiejie: The weather in Shanghai certainly isn’t as bad as in Guangzhou."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "圆圆：上个星期上海天天下雨。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：上個星期上海天天下雨。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shàng ge xīng qī shàng hǎi tiān tiān xià yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: It rained every day in Shanghai last week."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "杰杰：广州也下了七天雨。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：廣州也下了七天雨。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié guǎng zhōu yě xià le qī tiān yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jiejie: It rained for seven days in Guangzhou too."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "圆圆：上海的雨大得人人都不能出门。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：上海的雨大得人人都不能出門。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shàng hǎi de yǔ dà de rén rén dōu bù néng chū mén",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: It rained so heavily in Shanghai that nobody could go outside."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "杰杰：广州的雨大得火烈鸟都在街上游泳了。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：廣州的雨大得火烈鳥都在街上游泳了。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié guǎng zhōu de yǔ dà de huǒ liè niǎo dōu zài jiē shang yóu yǒng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jiejie: It rained so heavily in Guangzhou that flamingos even swam in the street."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "圆圆：我的天，广州的雨比上海大多了。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：我的天，廣州的雨比上海大多了。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán wǒ de tiān guǎng zhōu de yǔ bǐ shàng hǎi dà duō le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Oh my gosh. It really does rain more in Guangzhou than in Shanghai."
    }
  ],
