    "sentence_translations": [
      "Where Did It Rain The Most?",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: I went to Shanghai last week. The weather there was terrible.",
      "",
      "Jiejie: The weather in Shanghai certainly isn’t as bad as in Guangzhou.",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: It rained every day in Shanghai last week.",
      "",
      "Jiejie: It rained for seven days in Guangzhou too.",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: It rained so heavily in Shanghai that nobody could go outside.",
      "",
      "Jiejie: It rained so heavily in Guangzhou that flamingos even swam in the street.",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: Oh my gosh. It really does rain more in Guangzhou than in Shanghai.",
      ""
